        "text": "The Jewish community in Monsey, New York, and its surrounding neighborhoods, voted in very big numbers for me in our Historic 2024 Presidential Campaign. TREMENDOUS SUPPORT! TODAY, the eyes of the Country are on New York again! Congressman Mike Lawler has been a tremendous friend to the Jewish community and a strong leader in the fight against antisemitism. He has stood with the community when it mattered most, speaking out against hatred, and standing up for Religious Freedom and School Choice! Mike has worked tirelessly for his constituents, for our Country, and for the Jewish people. He understands the importance of strong leadership, protecting our communities, and delivering REAL RESULTS for the people he represents. His dedication to public service and his willingness to stand up for what he believes in have made a tremendous difference. That kind of commitment should never be taken for granted! Working together with your State Senator Bill Weber, Mike will continue to be your voice, and fight for you and your family! EVERY VOTE MATTERS. MAKE YOUR VOICE HEARD TODAY. VOTE MIKE LAWLER FOR CONGRESS — HE WILL NEVER LET YOU DOWN! President DONALD J. TRUMP",
