        "text": "The Daily Mail wrongly took my joke at a Presidential News Conference where the beautiful Lincoln Memorial Reflecting Pool was opened yesterday, and pretended it wasn't a joke when I said, I'm going to name it, \"TRUMP.\" Their dishonest, false headline states: \"Trump delivers final midterms speech to just 60 people at the renovated Reflecting Pool and threatens a major rename.\" It wasn't a \"Final Midterms Speech\" that only had 60 people, it was a NEWS CONFERENCE, nobody was invited, it was closed to the Public — Just Reporters. My Final Midterms Speech was the day before in lowa and Kansas, where we had 50,000 people. This just shows you how FAKE the News is. I said, very clearly, \"I'm joking.\" The Fake News is so corrupt! President DONALD J. TRUMP",
